bluejetty:00065563:ios.description:
The Dukan Method is the result of doctor and nutritionist Pierre Dukan’s 40 years of experience and is one of the most successful dieting tools in the world today.
Meet the official mobile app!
Main features:
• True Weight Calculator;
• Diet Diary: monitor your weight, physical activity and mood;
• Clear recommendations for each day;
• List of allowed foods with tips;
• 350 exclusive recipes;
• Food diary;
• Choice of alternating rhythm, from 1-1 to 5-5;
• Record your chest/waist/hip measurements in the diary;
• Body measurements chart;
• Store slimming progress photos;
• Option to write notes in the diary;
• Reminders with daily recommendations about walks and diary entries;
• Option to change True Weight;
• Mark your period in the diary and graph;
• Sync with Apple Watch;
• Reminders to drink water, with frequency settings.
The app uses data from the standard Health app for reading and noting your average weight and kilometres covered/steps taken.
SUBSCRIPTION PRICING & TERMS
The app is free to download. All customers are welcome to a free 7-day trial period. If you choose to continue use of the app, we offer a auto-renewing subscription options: monthly subscription, while the yearly subscription.
Payment will be charged to your credit card through your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours prior to the end of the subscription period. There is no increase in price when renewing.
Subscriptions can be managed and auto-renewal turned off in Account Settings in iTunes after purchase. Once purchased, refunds will not be provided for any unused portion of the term. Read our full Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy at http://www.owlylabs.com/privacy-policy-en/
If you have any comments or suggestions, please write to us at support@owlylabs.com

