bluejetty:00112621:android.description:
Developed by BRB to provide a better experience for users of Public Transport in the Federal District.
When registering on the App, you have access to your mobility cards and facilities that were previously only available in person at physical stations, such as:
· Recharge by bank slip and PIX;
· Pix recharge history;
· Top-up for third parties;
· Balance consultation and card usage statement;
· Expiring balance inquiry;
· Access to the Chatbot for questions, with human interaction;
· Access to bus routes.
Over time, BRB has invested in continuous improvements and security of the app, focusing on our customers' experience. Download it now and have the features and services that will make your journey easier in the palm of your hand.
Don't have a Mobility Card yet?
Register on the App and go to any of the BRB Mobilidade stations to receive your first copy free of charge.

